  ],
  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The standard nuclei segmentation algorithm in computational pathology — natively integrated into QuPath, Fiji, and napari, and used as the default segmentation backbone in countless pathology AI pipelines. BSD-3-Clause, v0.9.2 (December 2025), 1.2k stars, MPI-CBG/EPFL origin. Pretrained models available for H&E nuclei out of the box. The go-to choice for nucleus detection before committing to a deep learning segmentation pipeline.",
